module

/-!
# `EthLib.Base.Exports.Bindings`

The contract of each method of the Python extension, read by the binding generator.

Each entry names the specification operation whose docstring the method carries.

It names the export instead when the export reshapes the result, so the docstring stays true.
-/

public section

namespace EthLib.Exports

/-- One method of the Python extension. -/
structure Binding where
  /-- The name of the method in the method table of the extension. -/
  method : String
  /-- The declaration whose docstring the method carries: the operation, or a reshaping export. -/
  operation : Lean.Name
  /-- The Python signature of the method, from its arguments to its result. -/
  signature : String
  /-- The Lean error types whose codes the method can raise. -/
  errors : List Lean.Name
  /-- The class of `ethlib.errors` that the method raises, if it can fail. -/
  errorClass : Option String

/-- Every method of the Python extension, in the order of its method table. -/
